              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6004' id='24' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='3597'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'>• This dashboard tracks metrics related to the </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff2b85'>Weighted Items / Variable Prices </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'>feature in APAC shops.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'>• Only </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff2b85'>vendors with weighted items </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'>are considered on this dashboard.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'>• Please refer to </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff2b85'>definition</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'> tab for metric definitions.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#fc0107' fontname='Tableau Medium'>* Note: All metrics are based on an order&apos;s final basket, post-item removal (if any). This is because we currently lack data on weighted item basket updates.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
